{"pageid":3743,"title":"Spearmint Candy Cane","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Spearmint Candy Cane</span>","revid":21845,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About\">About</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Spearmint Candycane Tree</b> is the green version of the <a href=\"/wiki/Candy_Cane_Tree\" title=\"Candy Cane Tree\">Candy Cane</a> which is *slightly* less rare. \n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Spearmint Candycane</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest?cb=20251207110700\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Spearmint Candycane\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251207110700\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251207110700 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20251207110700 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Spearmint Candycane\" width=\"270\" height=\"222\" data-image-key=\"Spearmint_Candycane.png\" data-image-name=\"Spearmint Candycane.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">~875❄️/tree</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">?/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">?/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.71.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\nThey can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor\" title=\"Meteor\">Candycane Meteor</a> along with normal candy canes. The tree was originally introduced in 1.71.0 and was reintroduced in v1.97.0 as a limited time tree that spawned around the map.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Spearmint Candy Cane Tree is a large curving tree with no leaves. Its durability is similar to that of a <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma Tree</a> when struck by any axe. However, if the <a href=\"/wiki/Festive_Axe\" title=\"Festive Axe\">Festive Axe</a> is used to cut the Spearmint Candy Cane Tree, it gains an <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a>-like effect where it can chop the tree in only a few hits, which is the same as the normal candy cane tree.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Extra_Info\">Extra Info</span></h2>\n<p>After 1.97.5, Giant candycanes could also be found in this green varient \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 320px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/30/GiantCandycane.png/revision/latest?cb=20251214114354\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Giant spearmint candycane, image fromDaepiceditar9222\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/30/GiantCandycane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20251214114354\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"220\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"GiantCandycane.png\" data-image-key=\"GiantCandycane.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:GiantCandycane.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Giant spearmint candycane, image from<a href=\"/wiki/User:Daepiceditar9222\" title=\"User:Daepiceditar9222\">Daepiceditar9222</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902231420\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 67/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 53/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019468/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.829      1 Template:Wood\n100.00%   29.829      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3743-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902231420 and revision id 21845. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Trees","Limited"],"links":[{"title":"User:Daepiceditar9222","exists":false},{"title":"Candy Cane Tree","exists":true},{"title":"Emberbane","exists":true},{"title":"Festive Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Magma Tree","exists":true},{"title":"Meteor","exists":true}],"images":["Spearmint_Candycane.png","GiantCandycane.png"]}
